WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.485
Pitter patter,
let's get going?

00:00:01.485 --> 00:00:02.285
Yeah.

00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:04.040
Air ball.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.060
So do you want the good
news first, or the bad?

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.155
- Bad.
- That's it.

00:00:07.155 --> 00:00:07.955
Goodbye.

00:00:07.955 --> 00:00:09.516
This is the end of days!

00:00:09.516 --> 00:00:11.970
Not even their chainboy.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.420
What are we going
to do tell them?

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.770
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.715
Pitter patter.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.205
Let's get at her.

00:00:17.205 --> 00:00:18.055
Here's the kicker.

00:00:18.055 --> 00:00:19.372
[KICKING, PUNCHING]

00:00:19.372 --> 00:00:21.040
That's pretty good, you guys.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.840
OK?

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:22.640
Ferda.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.448
[DOOR CLICKING OPEN]

00:00:23.448 --> 00:00:25.140
So you haven't seen it?

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.770
Not yet, but the
suspense is killing me.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:27.570
[BARKING]

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.920
[AUDIO LOGO]

